  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "收碳稅，kám ē變散赤？ Pun紅利，逐家變好額！"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>主講／</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>潘翰聲</b></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>記錄／</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>吳玉祥</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>編按：本文是2023/1/6棲地復育台語講座ê摘要記錄，講者潘翰聲是「社團法人台灣樹人會」ê 理事長。</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b><br /></b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><b>台灣蠻野心足生態協會舉辦ê「蠻野講堂」tuì 2019年3月份起kap李江却台語文教基金會合辦規劃有關生態環境議題ê台語講座，歡迎逐家tī逐個月第三禮拜五暗時7點到9點，同齊來「呷米共食廚房」（台北市中正區衡陽路9號3樓）擴展家己ê台語棲地（tshe-tē）！詳細資料ē-tàng看「台灣蠻野心足生態協會」FB專頁。</b></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">十年前，台灣樹人會理事長潘翰聲bat踮tī街頭演講tshui-sak碳稅，講：「政府kan-tann敢管lán手--裡ê tsit枝薰，suah m̄敢去管台塑ê hit枝大煙筒。禁薰ê議題已經講beh 1、20冬--ah，lán台灣tio̍h肺癌ê人數猶原是排tī頭前名。Ē致著肺癌，空氣汙染就是上大ê兇手，所以lán beh來要求政府tio̍h-ài來khioh碳稅（能源稅），將tsit个稅金pun-phenn hōo民眾。」</span></div><div><span><a name='more'></a></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為地球現時已經發燒kah真嚴重，致使農業受著真大ê影響，為著beh來解決環保問題，無愛hōo lán ê囡仔未來變做氣候難民，全世界ê專家、學者包括政治家，眾人ê頭殼lóng tsiâu mooh leh燒。排碳量全世界排名第22，四面全是海ê台灣，ē用得講lán是加害者，mā是受害者。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上kài理想ê減碳款式，就是過簡單ê生活，mài做無必要ê消費kap浪費，m̄-koh簡單ê生活並無法度解決問題。潘翰聲認為tse是結構性ê問題，就是ài來破解資本主義。若是beh減碳，現實上是ài uì商業kap政治來解決，政府部門ài要求大公司做ESG&nbsp;<b style=\"font-size: x-small;\">[1]&nbsp;</b>報告，來證明公司有teh盡社會責任，是有道德ê企業。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">另外，uì源頭管理來講，m̄-nā ài省電費、省油錢，mā tio̍h省經濟，hōo經濟kap環保tsiânn做仝一項代誌。現此時，lán坐公車通勤一個月ê開銷，比騎oo-tóo-bái ê油錢khah傷重，beh做環保suah tio̍h-ài ke khai khah濟錢，愛護環境、teh做環保ê人suah tio̍h來補貼製造汙染ê人。Sóo-pái lán政策上tio̍h-ài hē精神來規畫，ài hōo無環保概念ê人，mā願意來做環保，譬如講親像pùn-sò袋仔ài收錢，kap碳稅是仝款道理。希望透過khioh碳稅來做pun-phenn，m̄-nā hōo地球變khah好，經濟順勢來產業升級，mā hōo資源分配ē-tàng koh-khah接近社會正義。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">石器時代所以ē來結束，並m̄是全世界lóng揣無石頭--ah，是因為人類揣著比石頭koh-khah好用ê鐵。若準未來石油時代ē結束，mā m̄是因為lán kā石油khai kah ta̋-ta--ah，是因為lán有比石油koh-khah清氣、koh-khah好ê mi̍h件。未來石油ē愈來愈貴，再生能源ē ná來ná俗。所以lán台灣m̄-thang koh慢慢仔等、慢慢仔tuè人行，lán ài冗早做準備，若án-ne就ē-tàng升級koh兼趁錢。現時lán台灣ê油價是東亞國家內底上kài俗--ê，就算是kā碳稅加加--入-去，lán ê價siàu仝款是tsiok有國際競爭力。未來ê市場，lán一定ài搶--著，台灣ê經濟tsiah ē有出路。&nbsp;</span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><h2 style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: center; text-indent: 0cm;\"><span class=\"a0\"><b><span face=\"&quot;jf金萱3.0 七分糖&quot;,sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;jf金萱3\\.0 七分糖&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">碳費</span></b></span><span class=\"a0\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">kap</span></span><span class=\"a0\"><b><span face=\"&quot;jf金萱3.0 七分糖&quot;,sans-serif\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: -0.3pt; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;jf金萱3\\.0 七分糖&quot;; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\">碳稅比較表</span></b></span></h2><div align=\"center\">\n\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed;\">\n <thead>\n  <tr style=\"height: 3pt; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; mso-yfti-irow: 0;\">\n   <td style=\"border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 39.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"53\">\n   <p align=\"center\" class=\"a\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-vertical-align-alt: auto; text-align: center;\"><span color=\"windowtext\" face=\"&quot;jf金萱3.0 七分糖&quot;,sans-serif\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"border-left: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 186.65pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"249\">\n   <p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">碳費</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n   </td>\n   <td style=\"border-left: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 248.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\n   <p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">碳稅</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n   </td>\n  </tr>\n </thead>\n <tbody><tr style=\"height: 3pt; mso-yfti-irow: 1;\">\n  <td style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 39.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"53\">\n  <p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">時效</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 186.65pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"249\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">ē-tàng</span></span><span class=\"a0\">短期內立法開始徵收</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 248.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">ài</span></span><span class=\"a0\">長期規畫</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，</span></span><span class=\"a0\">改革稅制</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height: 3pt; mso-yfti-irow: 2;\">\n  <td style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 39.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"53\">\n  <p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">徵收</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 186.65pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"249\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">尾站收費</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，</span></span><span class=\"a0\">大戶先收</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 248.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">源頭</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">khioh</span></span><span class=\"a0\">稅</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，</span></span><span class=\"a0\">全面公平</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height: 3pt; mso-yfti-irow: 3;\">\n  <td style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 39.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"53\">\n  <p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">性質</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 186.65pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"249\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">●</span></span><span class=\"a0\">專款專用</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p>\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">●</span></span><span class=\"a0\">環保署</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">ê</span></span><span class=\"a0\">小金庫</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p>\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">●</span></span><span class=\"a0\">額度有限</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，</span></span><span class=\"a0\">效益有限</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 248.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">●</span></span><span class=\"a0\">統收統支</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，ē-tàng</span></span><span class=\"a0\">指定用途</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p>\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\" style=\"margin-left: 12.75pt; text-indent: -12.75pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">●</span></span><span class=\"a0\">財政部仝步降所得稅</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，iah</span></span><span class=\"a0\">是算人頭</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">pun hōo</span></span><span class=\"a0\">國民</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height: 3pt; mso-yfti-irow: 4;\">\n  <td style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 39.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"53\">\n  <p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">效果</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 186.65pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"249\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">環保減碳、產業升級</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td style=\"border-bottom: 1pt solid black; border-left: none; border-right: 1pt solid black; border-top: none; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 248.1pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"331\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">環保減碳</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">、</span></span><span class=\"a0\">產業升級</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">、</span></span><span class=\"a0\">社會分配正義</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height: 3pt; mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;\">\n  <td colspan=\"3\" style=\"border-top: none; border: 1pt solid black; height: 3pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .75pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .75pt; padding: 1.4pt; width: 474.6pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"633\">\n  <p align=\"left\" class=\"7\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-indent: 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span class=\"a0\">若一直收碳費</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，</span></span><span class=\"a0\">無</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">khioh</span></span><span class=\"a0\">碳稅</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">，án-ne</span></span><span class=\"a0\">節能減碳</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">kan-tann</span></span><span class=\"a0\">是對個人</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">ê</span></span><span class=\"a0\">道道德款勸</span><span class=\"a0\"><span face=\"&quot;jf_金萱台語測試_W3 W3&quot;\">niā-niā。</span></span></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n</div><p align=\"center\" class=\"7\" style=\"margin-left: 0cm; text-align: center; text-indent: 0cm;\"><b><span class=\"a0\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; m